---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Owl Cam — 感谢购买" description="你的 Owl Cam Pro 密钥正在路上。" lang="zh" path="/zh/thanks">
  <section><div class="wrap sec-in">
    <span class="eyebrow">感谢购买</span>
    <h1 style="font-size:36px">密钥正在路上</h1>
    <div id="keybox" hidden>
      <p>这是你的授权密钥，同时也已发到你的邮箱。</p>
      <p><code id="key" style="font-size:20px;letter-spacing:.02em;user-select:all;padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:10px;background:var(--card);display:inline-block"></code>
      <button id="copy" class="btn" style="margin-left:10px">复制</button></p>
      <p>在 Owl Cam 里打开 <strong>设置 → 通用 → 授权</strong>，粘贴密钥并点击激活。每个密钥可在两台 Mac 上使用。</p>
    </div>
    <div id="mailbox">
      <p>Polar 会把授权密钥发到你结账时填写的邮箱，通常一分钟内到达。然后在 Owl Cam 里打开 <strong>设置 → 通用 → 授权</strong>，粘贴密钥并点击激活。</p>
      <p>没收到邮件？打开 <a href="https://polar.sh/owlcam/portal">你的 Polar 账户</a> 可查看所有密钥。每个密钥可在两台 Mac 上使用。</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <script is:inline>
  (async () => {
    const u = new URL(location.href); const t = u.searchParams.get('customer_session_token');
    if (!t) return;
    u.searchParams.delete('customer_session_token'); history.replaceState(null, '', u);
    try {
      const r = await fetch('https://api.polar.sh/v1/customer-portal/license-keys/?limit=5', { headers: { Authorization: 'Bearer ' + t } });
      if (!r.ok) return;
      const j = await r.json(); const k = (j.items || []).find(x => x.key && /^OWL-/.test(x.key)) || (j.items || [])[0];
      if (!k || !k.key) return;
      document.getElementById('key').textContent = k.key;
      document.getElementById('keybox').hidden = false; document.getElementById('mailbox').hidden = true;
      const b = document.getElementById('copy');
      b.onclick = async () => { try { await navigator.clipboard.writeText(k.key); b.textContent = '已复制'; setTimeout(() => b.textContent = '复制', 1500); } catch {} };
    } catch {}
  })();
  </script>
</Base>
